WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.040
Planets around other stars.

00:02.740 --> 00:11.699
More than six thousand planets around other stars, in the copy of NASA's catalogue this map carries, each drawn as a mark at its star.

00:12.149 --> 00:20.914
Most were found by the dip in a star's light as a planet crosses in front of it, the rest mostly by the wobble a planet gives its star.
